other moves are worse:** - Taking the pawn on a6 with the other cannon fails,
because the knight on c7 would capture it. - Rook takes the knight on g3 loses
the exchange, since the pawn on g4 and the rook on e3 both guard it. - **My
choice:** take the knight on c7 for the cannon. If black recaptures, it is an
even cannon-for-knight trade. It also removes one of the pieces black is
attacking with. } 车９平３ 19. 炮九平七 { [%emt 0:00:42] [%think 3154]
