车一平九捉马，结果多半是兑马。我子力落后，兑子不利。 所以把马退到 a3。
这个点不在两辆黑车的攻击线上，车 g1 也能继续留在原位防守。 } 车６平４ 31.
车三进三 { [%emt 0:00:40] [%think 2929] [%out 3143] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0]
[%cachewrite 2420] The main danger is black's d-file. The d4 rook covers the
whole file, so black threatens 車d2xd0+ to win my advisor, and my king could
not recapture on d0. I'll play 车三进三 (g1g4). The rook goes to g4 and attacks
the d4 rook along row 4, since e4 and f4 are empty. - **If 車d4xg4:** my 相e2
recaptures on g4. That also clears the d-file, so the d0 threat is gone. - **If
車d2xd0+ first:** my king steps to e1, then my rook takes on d4 (g4xd4). That
trades material back. } 前车进２ 32. 帅五进一 { [%emt 0:00:09] [%think 302]
[%out 406] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0] [%cachewrite 2441] 黑方车在 d0 贴身将军，且有
d4 车保护，帅不能吃；两子相邻，也无法垫将。帅上 e1 不受黑方任何子力攻击，e2
有相挡住，不会与将照面。这是唯一合法的应将着法。 } 后车进３ 0-1

